          "example:13-lambda-expressions/README_4.1.4.md:9",
          "tests:13-lambda-expressions/src/test/java/com/github/msorkhpar/claudejavatutor/lambdaexpressions/LambdaBestPracticesTest.java"
        ],
        "exercise": null,
        "reason": "Splitting nested lambdas into small named methods is shape, not behaviour: a test sees only the totals, so the totals practice offers the page's shape as advice and grades the results."
      },
      {
